<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Production Operators cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Production Operators cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Jefferies &amp; Co Inc analyst Byron Dunn said he cut his rating on Production Operators Corp to accumulate from buy.</p>
<p>-- Production Operators shares were 3/8 lower at 46-5/8 in morning trdaing on Nadaq.</p>
</text>
